<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0665_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThat reminds me... Phones turn your\nvoice into electricity to carry it\ffar, right?\rSo you could turn HOMIES into\nelectricity and send ’em far too!\rBased on that, I built the Homie\nStorage System! Patent pendin’!\rI also patented this phone call.\nYou owe me 50 cents.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThat reminds me... Phones turn your\nvoice into electricity to carry it\ffar, right?\rSo you could turn HOMIES into\nelectricity and send ’em far too!\rBased on that, I built the Homie\nStorage System! Patent pendin’!\rI also patented this phone call.\nYou owe me 50 cents.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who’s callin’?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? Hold up a sec...\nI’m upgradin’ the servers...\r...\n...\rOK, I unplugged the fridge. We good.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who’s callin’?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? Hold up a sec...\nI’m upgradin’ the servers...\r...\n...\rOK, I unplugged the fridge. We good.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, you on the PC Box named\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0} right now.\rEasy name to remember.\nEasy to remember is the move.\rCountin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right now you usin’ the PC Box named\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, right?\rThat name go HARD. I’mma steal it.\rCountin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So your PC Box called\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, right?\rThat ain’t no regular name. I got a\nfeelin’ you know a good name when\fyou see it...\rOK, countin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Call again sometime...\nI’ll be here. In my basement. Codin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your PC Boxes FULL!\rYou gotta release some homies if you\nwanna catch more.\fOr buy my premium plan. $9.99/month.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Bill.\rYou know your PC Boxes FULL, right?\rYou did a CRAZY job catchin’ homies!\nI tip my hat!\rBut with your Boxes full, you can’t\ncatch no more homies.\fThe servers is screamin’.\fI can hear ’em from here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Bill.\rYou know your PC Boxes FULL, right?\rYou did a CRAZY job catchin’ homies!\nI tip my hat!\rBut with your Boxes full, you can’t\ncatch no more homies.\fThe servers is screamin’.\fI can hear ’em from here.</language>
	</row>
</body>
